OL,3,ABurnham and Macron agree to scale up
OL,4,Aaction on small boats
OL,5,
OL,6,FBurnham said it was "so fitting" that
OL,7,FMacron was his first overseas visitor
OL,8,Fsince becoming PM in July, describing
OL,9,Fhim as "our nearest neighbour and close
OL,10,Ffriend Emmanuel".
